---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What Scaleseek collects when you read the site.">
  <div class="wrap page">
    <article class="article">
      <a class="back" href="/">&larr; Home</a>
      <h1>Privacy</h1>
      <p class="lede">Last updated Oct 29, 2026.</p>
      <div class="prose">
        <p>
          Scaleseek is a static site. It sets no cookies, runs no analytics or advertising scripts, and has no
          accounts or sign up forms. Fonts are served from this site, not from a third party.
        </p>
        <h2>Server logs</h2>
        <p>
          The host that serves these pages may keep standard request logs, such as IP address, browser and the
          page requested, for security and troubleshooting. Those logs are not used to identify readers.
        </p>
        <h2>Email</h2>
        <p>
          If you write to hello@scaleseek.com, your message and address are kept only to reply to you and are
          never shared or sold.
        </p>
        <h2>Questions</h2>
        <p>Write to hello@scaleseek.com and you will get an answer from a person.</p>
      </div>
    </article>
  </div>
</Base>
